                        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:bids@mbdoor.com" style="color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: none;">bids@mbdoor.com</a></p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong>Emergency:</strong> <a href="tel:(831)757-1878" style="color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: none;">(831) 757-1878</a></p>
                        <p><strong>Response Time:</strong> Same day in primary coverage areas</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div style="background-color: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: var(--border-radius); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                        <h4 style="color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Business Information</h4>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Monterey Bay Door</strong></p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">1630 Lana Way Bldg B</p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Hollister, California 95023</p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Licensed • Bonded • Insured</p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Installs by Staley Construction</p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">California Contractor's License #858597</p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">Serving Central California since 2007</p>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div style="background-color: white; padding: 2rem; border-radius: var(--border-radius); box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);">
                        <h4 style="color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Business Hours</h4>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Monday - Friday:</strong> 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM</p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Saturday:</strong> 8:00 AM - 12:00 PM</p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"><strong>Sunday:</strong> Emergency service only</p>
                        <p style="margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong>Emergency Service:</strong> 24/7 availability</p>
                        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666;">Emergency response available 24/7 for critical access control failures at hotels, hospitals, and other facilities requiring immediate attention.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

